  npcName: Mom
  npcPortrait: {fileID: 5001900695801274064, guid: ea00ea5ae3868b042ac0e87b8af64bc8, type: 3}
  dialogueLines:
  - Yawn...
  - Good morning, son!
  - Ready for the big day? Graduation!! We're so proud of you.
  - I can't wait for the ceremony, and neither can your father.
  - Make sure you speak to him before you leave!
  - I'm sure you know, but your graduation is being held at the castle in the nearest
    city.
  - Take care on your journey!
  - Ah, I just remembered, we forgot to bring back your gift...
  - This is a great opportunity for some sight-seeing!
  - You'll find your gift at the old oak tree, north of town.
  - Bye now, good luck!
